    "body": "OWNER direction: remove the Night School layer and keep the actual DUNCAN core model.\n\nBase: `main@24be27a360d92af83a85d127a6660ebaa47488e0`\nHead: `duncan/remove-night-school-r01`\n\nThis cleanup:\n- preserves `DUNCAN = PRIME_CORE + SELF_MODEL + OWNER_TASTE_MODEL + PROJECT_MEMORY + VERIFIED_SKILLS + EPISODIC_EXPERIENCE + CURRENT_CONTEXT` as a direct core model;\n- removes Night School language from active `AGENTS.md` law;\n- removes the mandatory derived-context runtime bridge;\n- removes the DUNCAN Night School reducer and its tests;\n- removes Night School derivation from Permanent Archive V1;\n- detaches archive integrity verification from Night School derived state;\n- keeps the RAW Permanent Archive and project evidence intact;\n- adds `docs/DUNCAN_PRIME_MODEL.md` as the compact durable core contract.\n\nNo canon/production authority expansion. No RAW archive rewrite. No claim that historical Git data disappeared; this removes the active subsystem from current code/law.",
